          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A witness provides the gendarmes on September 29, 2005, photos of a sunset taken on June 23, 2005, on a beach in the island of Noirmoutier. One of the photos shows a luminous phenomenon. The photographs were taken on a north-west axis. The witness provided no description with this deposition. No other testimony regarding this phenomenon has been collected, and we lack information about it.",
